  "abstract": "Test spatial smoothness on neuron loadings via TV penalty on U (sum of squared first differences across neuron index). Base LN-SSM config with MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4) and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5). Hypothesis: smoother U improves robustness and long-horizon MAE.",
